    body: '10:30am - Doors<br>11:00am - Artist Talks<br>12:30pm - Event Wrap<br><br><a href="https://www.instagram.com/thefirehousejt/?hl=en" target="_blank" rel="noopener">The Firehouse</a><br>65430 Winters Road<br>Joshua Tree, CA'
