    title: "Points for Clouds, Dreams Aroused",
    meta: "",
    body: 'A multi-media exhibition celebrating Siggraph’s 50th Anniversary Conference in Los Angeles.<br><br>Opening Reception:<br>Thursday, August 10th<br>5pm - 12pm<br><br>Projekt Blank<br><a href="https://s2023.siggraph.org/index.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">SIGGRAPH 2023</a><br><a href="https://www.joinai.la/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Artificial Intelligence Los Angeles</a><br><br>Future Factory<br>417 E. 15th St.<br>Los Angeles, CA<br>90016'
