    body: "A screening of the feature-length video work <em>A Monastic Gig</em>, as well as the music video for <em>Rent a New Place, Everything Could Change</em>, will coincide with a record release and listening party for Laraaji, Merz, and Shahzad Ismaily’s new double album <em>Dreams of Sleep and Wakes of Sound</em>.<br><br>Event Time:<br>9/1/19<br>7pm<br><br>FURSTWURLD<br>8528 Desert Shadows Rd.<br>Joshua Tree, California"
